### Defensive Countermeasures

| Control | Detail |
|---------|--------|
| **D3-NTF** (Network Traffic Filtering) | Block or rate-limit passive DNS enumeration from unknown sources |
| **D3-DNSAL** (DNS Allowlisting) | Restrict zone transfer; monitor for subdomain brute-force patterns |
| **WAF / CDN masking** | Avoid direct-origin exposure on live subdomains |
| **Certificate Transparency monitoring** | Alert on new cert issuance for your domain via [crt.sh](https://crt.sh) |

